   "created_at": "2026-07-31T22:17:01.763Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/edzitron.com/post/3mrxya5qphs2u",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "I stood with local and state elected officials to say that we cannot approve any more AI data centers until we have federal guardrails to protect local communities like Saline Township from being run over by the likes of DTE, Oracle, and OpenAI.",
