   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "This was meant to be due when OpenAI ipo’d or hit AGI, neither of which happened. Suggests OpenAI is burning way too much money and Amazon is trying to post another net equity gain in Q3, likely to try and paper over what was weak revenue guidance",
   "handle": "edzitron.com",
